# Runesmith's digests (kernel, organs, generations) are computed over bytes, so every checkout keeps LF,
# whatever the platform. The Windows launcher is the one exception: cmd.exe wants CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.zip binary
# Field-training logs are evidence: receipts may hash them, and some have mixed line endings, so keep their exact bytes.
TRAINER_LOG.md -text
READ_ME_TRAINER_NOW.md -text
training/**/*.md -text
